					<h1>ConvergEx Global Markets</h1>
					
					<H2>World-Class Expertise and Ease of Execution.</H2>
<P>ConvergEx Global Markets Ltd. provides full-service, global agency trading in over 100 markets worldwide, around the clock. Our core capabilities include global portfolio trading, block trading, portfolio rebalancing, foreign exchange, liquidations and transitions. We provide clients with conflict-free, anonymous execution from a single point of contact. And our clients can leverage our experience as one of the premier settlement agents in some of the world’s most complex markets.</P>
<P>Our ConvergEx Global Markets professionals also have extensive experience in dealing with multiple securities and markets simultaneously. Through our dealing center in Bermuda we offer 24-hour trading and support. Our regional offices include New York, London and&nbsp;Hong Kong. </P>
